cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research artifact, cite the archived release or the final paper when available."
type: software
title: "Canary Memorization Study: Controlled Exposure and Compositional Creativity"
authors:
  - family-names: Khanal
    given-names: Aarav
repository-code: "https://github.com/Aaravkhanal/canary-memorization-study"
abstract: >-
  Code, protocols, configurations, and exploratory artifacts for controlled
  narrative-canary memorization experiments in small language models. The
  contamination-free 24-cell confirmatory computational grid and its frozen
  exposure analysis are complete; the human novelty endpoint remains pending.
license: MIT
keywords:
  - language-model memorization
  - canary exposure
  - compositional generalization
  - reproducibility
